  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a2598e857b284925a344cfeb3fb12f50, type: 3}
  m_Name: Linh_CityIntro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerName: LINH
  portrait: {fileID: -1297769870653861099, guid: b2dcf0c911c6cdd4ea996aa2005d4ebb, type: 3}
  continuePrompt: Enter c to continue
  closePrompt: "Nh\u1EA5n C \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\xF3ng"
  lines:
  - english: This is Linh. I work for the National Security Bureau.
    vietnamese: "T\xF4i l\xE0 Linh. T\xF4i l\xE0m vi\u1EC7c cho C\u1EE5c An ninh
      Qu\u1ED1c gia."
  - english: "I\u2019m calling you because you\u2019re a special forces soldier on
      a rescue mission in the city. I need your help."
    vietnamese: "T\xF4i li\xEAn l\u1EA1c v\u1EDBi anh v\xEC anh l\xE0 l\xEDnh \u0111\u1EB7c
      nhi\u1EC7m \u0111ang l\xE0m nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5 c\u1EE9u h\u1ED9 trong th\xE0nh
      ph\u1ED1. T\xF4i c\u1EA7n anh gi\xFAp."
  - english: "Strange creatures are all over the city. They\u2019re breaking windows
      and damaging cars."
    vietnamese: "Sinh v\u1EADt l\u1EA1 xu\u1EA5t hi\u1EC7n kh\u1EAFp th\xE0nh ph\u1ED1.
      Ch\xFAng \u0111ang \u0111\u1EADp v\u1EE1 c\u1EEDa k\xEDnh v\xE0 ph\xE1 h\u1ECFng
      xe c\u1ED9."
  - english: Some streets are blocked. People are hiding in shops and houses.
    vietnamese: "M\u1ED9t s\u1ED1 con \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECB ch\u1EB7n.
      M\u1ECDi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111ang tr\u1ED1n trong c\xE1c c\u1EEDa h\xE0ng
      v\xE0 nh\xE0 d\xE2n."
  - english: A strange object fell from the sky and landed in the city park. It has
      a metal shell and a small blue light.
    vietnamese: "M\u1ED9t v\u1EADt th\u1EC3 l\u1EA1 r\u01A1i t\u1EEB tr\xEAn tr\u1EDDi
      xu\u1ED1ng v\xE0 \u0111\xE1p xu\u1ED1ng c\xF4ng vi\xEAn th\xE0nh ph\u1ED1.
      N\xF3 c\xF3 v\u1ECF kim lo\u1EA1i v\xE0 m\u1ED9t \xE1nh \u0111\xE8n xanh nh\u1ECF."
  - english: There are creatures on the streets near the park. They all stay away
      from the object. We need to find out why.
    vietnamese: "C\xF3 sinh v\u1EADt l\u1EA1 tr\xEAn c\xE1c con \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng
      g\u1EA7n c\xF4ng vi\xEAn. T\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 ch\xFAng \u0111\u1EC1u tr\xE1nh
      xa v\u1EADt th\u1EC3. Ch\xFAng ta c\u1EA7n t\xECm hi\u1EC3u l\xFD do."
  - english: Go to the park and check the object. Take any items you find inside.
    vietnamese: "H\xE3y \u0111\u1EBFn c\xF4ng vi\xEAn v\xE0 ki\u1EC3m tra v\u1EADt
      th\u1EC3. H\xE3y l\u1EA5y nh\u1EEFng v\u1EADt ph\u1EA9m anh t\xECm th\u1EA5y
      b\xEAn trong."
